# 5. High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Sources[Trigger Sources] --> Ingest[Event Ingestion]
    Ingest --> Normalize[Event Normalizer]
    Normalize --> Dedupe[Deduplication and Debounce]
    Dedupe --> Matcher[Automation Matcher]
    Matcher --> Evaluator[Condition Evaluator]
    Evaluator --> Scheduler[Execution Scheduler]
    Scheduler --> Executor[Automation Executor]
    Executor --> Scenes[Scene Engine]
    Executor --> Commands[Unified Command Bus]
    Scenes --> Plugins[Device Plugins]
    Commands --> Plugins
    Executor --> History[Execution History]
    Executor --> Diagnostics[Diagnostics]
    Store[Automation Store] --> Matcher
    Store --> Evaluator
    Store --> Scheduler
```

The UI must not listen directly to vendor events or execute device commands.

All automation activity passes through normalized platform boundaries.

