# 8. Trigger Model

```swift
enum AutomationTrigger: Codable, Sendable, Equatable {
    case time(TimeTrigger)
    case sunrise(SolarTrigger)
    case sunset(SolarTrigger)
    case deviceState(DeviceStateTrigger)
    case deviceAvailability(DeviceAvailabilityTrigger)
    case sensor(SensorTrigger)
    case presence(PresenceTrigger)
    case sceneCompleted(SceneCompletionTrigger)
    case appEvent(AppEventTrigger)
    case manual(ManualTrigger)
}
```

Each automation has one primary trigger in version 1.

Multiple trigger support may be introduced later through compound trigger groups.

