# 16. Manual Triggers

Manual triggers allow an automation to behave like an advanced reusable workflow.

They may be launched from:

- Automation detail.
- Home dashboard shortcut.
- Search.
- App Intent in a future release.
- Diagnostic test mode.

Manual runs still evaluate conditions unless the user explicitly selects a test mode that explains any bypass.

