# 31. Execution Lifecycle

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received
    Received --> Matched
    Matched --> Evaluating
    Evaluating --> Skipped: conditions fail
    Evaluating --> Scheduled: eligible
    Scheduled --> Running
    Running --> Succeeded
    Running --> PartialSuccess
    Running --> Failed
    Running --> Cancelled
    Skipped --> [*]
    Succeeded --> [*]
    PartialSuccess --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
```

```swift
enum AutomationRunState: Sendable, Equatable {
    case received
    case evaluating
    case skipped(AutomationSkipReason)
    case scheduled
    case running(progress: AutomationProgress)
    case succeeded
    case partialSuccess
    case failed(AutomationRunError)
    case cancelled
}
```

