# 36. Correlation Model

```swift
struct AutomationExecutionContext: Sendable {
    let correlationID: CorrelationID
    let causationID: String?
    let ancestorAutomationIDs: [AutomationID]
    let initiatedBy: ExecutionInitiator
}
```

Every command and scene run started by an automation should carry the same correlation ID where platform boundaries permit.

Reflected device events should retain causation metadata when possible.

When metadata cannot cross a vendor boundary, bounded heuristic loop detection remains necessary.

