# 42. Automation Health

```swift
enum AutomationHealth: Sendable, Equatable {
    case healthy
    case warning([AutomationIssue])
    case invalid([AutomationIssue])
    case temporarilyUnavailable([AutomationIssue])
}
```

Issues may include:

- Referenced device removed.
- Referenced scene missing.
- Capability no longer supported.
- Permission denied.
- Location unavailable.
- Notification permission denied.
- Integration authentication expired.
- Background reliability limitation.

Invalid automations must not execute.

Warnings may allow execution when safe.

