# 43. Validation

Validation occurs:

- During creation.
- Before saving.
- After device registry changes.
- After scene edits.
- After permission changes.
- Before every run.

```swift
protocol AutomationValidating: Sendable {
    func validate(_ automation: AuraAutomation) async -> AutomationValidationResult
}
```

Validation must confirm:

- Trigger is complete.
- Conditions reference available types.
- Actions are valid.
- Referenced devices or scenes exist.
- Required capabilities remain supported.
- No prohibited recursive reference exists.
- Runtime limits are respected.

